      "role": "user",
      "content": "but you're being kind of vague. if you look at the \"history and tradition\" test from Bruen, it pretty much makes any modern regulation look like a stretch. isn't it basically true that the old way of interpreting the amendment is the only one that's actually legally sound now?",
